What can I say but 'bravo'?
<p>The sheer rush of adrenaline from knowing that someone is out there trying to end my life&#8230; by God, it makes me feel alive. Holly and Bumaro are clutching their pearls at this development, but I speak for more than just myself when I say that this is the perfect addition to our game. I can definitely see why you've taken an interest in this Mann character.</p>
<p>Bravo, Fritz, bravo.</p>
<div style="display: inline-block; border:solid 2px #275495; background:#275495; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px"></div>
