<p><a name="Part6"></a></p>
<div style="background: url(&quot;http://scptestwiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/yurt/seal.png&quot;) top 5px right 5px no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 3px #444444; width: 85%; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);">
