</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align:right"><strong>To:</strong></th>
<td><span style="color: #95275e"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">administrator@site01.scp.int</span></span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align:right"><strong>Subject:</strong></th>
<td>What the hell?</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align:right"><strong>Date:</strong></th>
<td>05/02/06</td>
