<div style="display: inline-block; border:solid 2px #95275e; background:#95275e; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px"></div>
<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span>
<p>Imagine my surprise as I open the door of my studio and get assaulted in broad daylight by none other than your very own Mann boy.</p>
<p>He turned the goddamn sidewalk into a Pollock using my own blood and nearly ripped off my arms. My head was still reeling from the curbstomps after I woke up in my new body. All for some intel on where you were. I was ambivalent about your experiment at first, but now I have some critique to offer: In short, that wasn't very cool.</p>
<div style="display: inline-block; border:solid 2px #95275e; background:#95275e; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px"></div>
<br />
Yours,<br />
The Critic<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></div>
