<th>Re:</th>
<td>This shit</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">Yo,<br />
<br />
Pretty wild how your boy is out there just blowing up your spaceships. I thought you had this guy under control, lol. You should probably do something about it. Or don't. I'm not your dad.<br />
<br />
- JK (BF)</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p>
<div style="background: url(http://kaktuskontainer.wdfiles.com/local--files/graves2/gock.png) top right no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 3px #275495; width: 85%; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);">
