<th style="text-align:right"><strong>From:</strong></th>
<td><span style="color: red"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">maria_jones@scp.raisa.int</span></span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align:right"><strong>To:</strong></th>
<td><span style="color: red"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">administrator@site01.scp.in</span></span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align:right"><strong>Subject:</strong></th>
<td>Break-In</td>
