<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p>
<div class="page">
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
I'm immortal now. Not long-lived, not slow to age. Un-aging. One of Them. I don't know how long they've been playing this game or when they started or why. But I'm part of it now.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
I've been assigned the role &quot;Nobody&quot;. My &quot;win condition&quot; is to kill the rest of them. They're mocking me.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
The joke's on them. I left this life because I thought the world needed a better Mann. I wanted my life to be more than violence and death. But they've taught me better.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
There is no greater good &#8212; nor catch, nor collateral, nor consequence. But the joy of adventure, the thrill of the hunt, the fire inside me? Those are real.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
I've assembled all my notes and files for you, the new Overseers, as a warning. You know now what I accomplished as an old man. Ask yourself what I could do as an immortal, then do us both a favor and walk away.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
And Fritz, if you're reading this? I've got a grudge against you, and all the time in the world to hold it. I've even got a to-do list.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">TO DO:</span></strong><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">KILL FRITZ.</span></strong><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p>
</div>
